{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00833","headline":"郊庙歌辞 晋朝飨乐章 初举酒文同乐 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 晋朝飨乐章 初举酒文同乐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"赫矣昌运，明哉圣王。\n文兴坠典，礼复旧章。\n鸳鸾济济，鸟兽跄跄。\n一人有庆，万福无疆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00833.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00833","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}